{"slug": "message-queues", "voice": "af_heart", "accent": "us", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 331.025, "contentHash": "537151d3e21e88fc45bf543d315a8683adbd3c2558bb718642f16b751da26079", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "Message Queues", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.725, "words": [{"text": "Message", "start": 0.4, "end": 0.75}, {"text": "Queues", "start": 0.75, "end": 1.45}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "Decoupling producers from consumers with queues: delivery guarantees, ordering, backpressure, and how Kafka, RabbitMQ, and SQS differ.", "start": 1.725, "end": 11.15, "words": [{"text": "Decoupling", "start": 2.0, "end": 2.475}, {"text": "producers", "start": 2.475, "end": 3.075}, {"text": "from", "start": 3.075, "end": 3.225}, {"text": "consumers", "start": 3.225, "end": 3.788}, {"text": "with", "start": 3.788, "end": 3.95}, {"text": "queues", "start": 3.95, "end": 4.725}, {"text": "delivery", "start": 4.725, "end": 5.275}, {"text": "guarantees", "start": 5.275, "end": 6.075}, {"text": "ordering", "start": 6.075, "end": 6.65}, {"text": "backpressure", "start": 6.65, "end": 7.575}, {"text": "and", "start": 7.575, "end": 7.8}, {"text": "how", "start": 7.8, "end": 7.988}, {"text": "Kafka", "start": 7.988, "end": 8.6}, {"text": "RabbitMQ", "start": 8.6, "end": 9.55}, {"text": "and", "start": 9.55, "end": 9.737}, {"text": "SQS", "start": 9.737, "end": 10.275}, {"text": "differ", "start": 10.275, "end": 10.9}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 11.15, "end": 12.85, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 11.5, "end": 11.662}, {"text": "this", "start": 11.662, "end": 11.85}, {"text": "matters", "start": 11.85, "end": 12.575}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "Sooner or later, every growing system hits the same wall: Service A needs Service B to do something, but Service B is slow, or down, or drowning. If A calls B directly and waits, A's fate is chained to B's worst day. A message queue breaks that chain. A drops a message in the queue and walks away; B picks it up when it's ready. The queue absorbs spikes, survives outages, and lets each side scale independently. Email notifications, order processing, image resizing, fraud checks — the unglamorous plumbing of the internet runs on queues.", "start": 12.85, "end": 47.075, "words": [{"text": "Sooner", "start": 13.175, "end": 13.5}, {"text": "or", "start": 13.5, "end": 13.625}, {"text": "later", "start": 13.625, "end": 13.975}, {"text": "every", "start": 13.975, "end": 14.375}, {"text": "growing", "start": 14.375, "end": 14.775}, {"text": "system", "start": 14.775, "end": 15.175}, {"text": "hits", "start": 15.175, "end": 15.45}, {"text": "the", "start": 15.45, "end": 15.575}, {"text": "same", "start": 15.575, "end": 15.85}, {"text": "wall", "start": 15.85, "end": 16.5}, {"text": "Service", "start": 16.5, "end": 17.012}, {"text": "A", "start": 17.012, "end": 17.25}, {"text": "needs", "start": 17.25, "end": 17.525}, {"text": "Service", "start": 17.525, "end": 17.875}, {"text": "B", "start": 17.875, "end": 18.05}, {"text": "to", "start": 18.05, "end": 18.15}, {"text": "do", "start": 18.15, "end": 18.325}, {"text": "something", "start": 18.325, "end": 18.8}, {"text": "but", "start": 18.8, "end": 19.012}, {"text": "Service", "start": 19.012, "end": 19.375}, {"text": "B", "start": 19.375, "end": 19.6}, {"text": "is", "start": 19.6, "end": 19.75}, {"text": "slow", "start": 19.75, "end": 20.225}, {"text": "or", "start": 20.225, "end": 20.45}, {"text": "down", "start": 20.45, "end": 20.825}, {"text": "or", "start": 20.825, "end": 21.0}, {"text": "drowning", "start": 21.0, "end": 21.9}, {"text": "If", "start": 21.9, "end": 22.163}, {"text": "A", "start": 22.163, "end": 22.25}, {"text": "calls", "start": 22.25, "end": 22.625}, {"text": "B", "start": 22.625, "end": 22.8}, {"text": "directly", "start": 22.8, "end": 23.288}, {"text": "and", "start": 23.288, "end": 23.4}, {"text": "waits", "start": 23.4, "end": 23.85}, {"text": "A's", "start": 23.85, "end": 24.3}, {"text": "fate", "start": 24.3, "end": 24.525}, {"text": "is", "start": 24.525, "end": 24.688}, {"text": "chained", "start": 24.688, "end": 25.0}, {"text": "to", "start": 25.0, "end": 25.1}, {"text": "B's", "start": 25.1, "end": 25.375}, {"text": "worst", "start": 25.375, "end": 25.675}, {"text": "day", "start": 25.675, "end": 26.325}, {"text": "A", "start": 26.325, "end": 26.6}, {"text": "message", "start": 26.6, "end": 27.012}, {"text": "queue", "start": 27.012, "end": 27.25}, {"text": "breaks", "start": 27.25, "end": 27.575}, {"text": "that", "start": 27.575, "end": 27.812}, {"text": "chain", "start": 27.812, "end": 28.475}, {"text": "A", "start": 28.475, "end": 28.725}, {"text": "drops", "start": 28.725, "end": 29.062}, {"text": "a", "start": 29.062, "end": 29.125}, {"text": "message", "start": 29.125, "end": 29.513}, {"text": "in", "start": 29.513, "end": 29.587}, {"text": "the", "start": 29.587, "end": 29.688}, {"text": "queue", "start": 29.688, "end": 30.0}, {"text": "and", "start": 30.0, "end": 30.125}, {"text": "walks", "start": 30.125, "end": 30.413}, {"text": "away", "start": 30.413, "end": 30.85}, {"text": "B", "start": 30.85, "end": 31.15}, {"text": "picks", "start": 31.15, "end": 31.362}, {"text": "it", "start": 31.362, "end": 31.438}, {"text": "up", "start": 31.438, "end": 31.587}, {"text": "when", "start": 31.587, "end": 31.712}, {"text": "it's", "start": 31.712, "end": 31.9}, {"text": "ready", "start": 31.9, "end": 32.65}, {"text": "The", "start": 32.65, "end": 32.962}, {"text": "queue", "start": 32.962, "end": 33.263}, {"text": "absorbs", "start": 33.263, "end": 33.75}, {"text": "spikes", "start": 33.75, "end": 34.325}, {"text": "survives", "start": 34.325, "end": 34.925}, {"text": "outages", "start": 34.925, "end": 35.6}, {"text": "and", "start": 35.6, "end": 35.8}, {"text": "lets", "start": 35.8, "end": 36.075}, {"text": "each", "start": 36.075, "end": 36.312}, {"text": "side", "start": 36.312, "end": 36.65}, {"text": "scale", "start": 36.65, "end": 37.025}, {"text": "independently", "start": 37.025, "end": 38.025}, {"text": "Email", "start": 38.025, "end": 38.95}, {"text": "notifications", "start": 38.95, "end": 40.025}, {"text": "order", "start": 40.025, "end": 40.425}, {"text": "processing", "start": 40.425, "end": 41.225}, {"text": "image", "start": 41.225, "end": 41.675}, {"text": "resizing", "start": 41.675, "end": 42.325}, {"text": "fraud", "start": 42.325, "end": 42.763}, {"text": "checks", "start": 42.763, "end": 43.6}, {"text": "the", "start": 43.6, "end": 43.837}, {"text": "unglamorous", "start": 43.837, "end": 44.562}, {"text": "plumbing", "start": 44.562, "end": 44.913}, {"text": "of", "start": 44.913, "end": 44.988}, {"text": "the", "start": 44.988, "end": 45.1}, {"text": "internet", "start": 45.1, "end": 45.562}, {"text": "runs", "start": 45.562, "end": 45.888}, {"text": "on", "start": 45.888, "end": 46.087}, {"text": "queues", "start": 46.087, "end": 46.825}]}, {"index": 4, "kind": "prose", "text": "Think of it like a restaurant's order counter. The waitstaff (producers) scribble orders and clip them to the rail — they don't stand there watching the cooks. The kitchen (consumers) grabs tickets at its own pace. If the kitchen gets slammed, tickets pile up on the rail instead of waiters freezing mid-dining-room. The rail is the queue, and the whole restaurant would collapse without it.", "start": 47.075, "end": 69.5, "words": [{"text": "Think", "start": 47.35, "end": 47.513}, {"text": "of", "start": 47.513, "end": 47.6}, {"text": "it", "start": 47.6, "end": 47.725}, {"text": "like", "start": 47.725, "end": 47.913}, {"text": "a", "start": 47.913, "end": 48.0}, {"text": "restaurant's", "start": 48.0, "end": 48.525}, {"text": "order", "start": 48.525, "end": 48.85}, {"text": "counter", "start": 48.85, "end": 49.7}, {"text": "The", "start": 49.7, "end": 49.975}, {"text": "waitstaff", "start": 49.975, "end": 50.675}, {"text": "producers", "start": 50.675, "end": 51.375}, {