g", "start": 65.588, "end": 65.588}, {"text": "room", "start": 65.588, "end": 65.588}, {"text": "The", "start": 65.588, "end": 65.738}, {"text": "rail", "start": 65.738, "end": 66.1}, {"text": "is", "start": 66.1, "end": 66.25}, {"text": "the", "start": 66.25, "end": 66.363}, {"text": "queue", "start": 66.363, "end": 66.9}, {"text": "and", "start": 66.9, "end": 67.113}, {"text": "the", "start": 67.113, "end": 67.213}, {"text": "whole", "start": 67.213, "end": 67.475}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 67.475, "end": 67.912}, {"text": "would", "start": 67.912, "end": 68.05}, {"text": "collapse", "start": 68.05, "end": 68.488}, {"text": "without", "start": 68.488, "end": 68.8}, {"text": "it", "start": 68.8, "end": 69.25}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "The basic shape", "start": 69.5, "end": 71.175, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 69.825, "end": 69.9}, {"text": "basic", "start": 69.9, "end": 70.338}, {"text": "shape", "start": 70.338, "end": 70.9}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "Producers and consumers never talk to each other directly — they only know the queue. That decoupling buys you three things: temporal decoupling (B can be down when A sends), load leveling (spikes become a backlog, not an outage), and independent scaling (add consumers without touching producers).", "start": 71.175, "end": 89.8, "words": [{"text": "Producers", "start": 71.425, "end": 72.075}, {"text": "and", "start": 72.075, "end": 72.2}, {"text": "consumers", "start": 72.2, "end": 72.812}, {"text": "never", "start": 72.812, "end": 73.125}, {"text": "talk", "start": 73.125, "end": 73.4}, {"text": "to", "start": 73.4, "end": 73.487}, {"text": "each", "start": 73.487, "end": 73.638}, {"text": "other", "start": 73.638, "end": 73.85}, {"text": "directly", "start": 73.85, "end": 74.638}, {"text": "they", "start": 74.638, "end": 74.875}, {"text": "only", "start": 74.875, "end": 75.175}, {"text": "know", "start": 75.175, "end": 75.375}, {"text": "the", "start": 75.375, "end": 75.