.2}, {"text": "rail", "start": 200.2, "end": 200.5}, {"text": "overflows", "start": 200.5, "end": 201.425}]}, {"index": 17, "kind": "prose", "text": "Queues absorb spikes — until they can't. Every queue is finite, and \"what happens when it's full\" is a design decision, not an accident:", "start": 201.65, "end": 210.3, "words": [{"text": "Queues", "start": 201.925, "end": 202.25}, {"text": "absorb", "start": 202.25, "end": 202.675}, {"text": "spikes", "start": 202.675, "end": 203.325}, {"text": "until", "start": 203.325, "end": 203.662}, {"text": "they", "start": 203.662, "end": 203.812}, {"text": "can't", "start": 203.812, "end": 204.55}, {"text": "Every", "start": 204.55, "end": 205.062}, {"text": "queue", "start": 205.062, "end": 205.35}, {"text": "is", "start": 205.35, "end": 205.5}, {"text": "finite", "start": 205.5, "end": 206.125}, {"text": "and", "start": 206.125, "end": 206.4}, {"text": "what", "start": 206.4, "end": 206.575}, {"text": "happens", "start": 206.575, "end": 206.938}, {"text": "when", "start": 206.938, "end": 207.062}, {"text": "it's", "start": 207.062, "end": 207.238}, {"text": "full", "start": 207.238, "end": 207.6}, {"text": "is", "start": 207.6, "end": 207.787}, {"text": "a", "start": 207.787, "end": 207.85}, {"text": "design", "start": 207.85, "end": 208.25}, {"text": "decision", "start": 208.25, "end": 208.875}, {"text": "not", "start": 208.875, "end": 209.188}, {"text": "an", "start": 209.188, "end": 209.275}, {"text": "accident", "start": 209.275, "end": 210.05}]}, {"index": 18, "kind": "prose", "text": "Block the producer — simple, but now the producer feels the pain (RabbitMQ does this with publisher confirms and flow control).", "start": 210.3, "end": 218.475, "words": [{"text": "Block", "start": 210.55, "end": 210.825}, {"text": "the", "start": 210.825, "end": 210.925}, {"text": "producer", "start": 210.925, "end": 211.475}, {"text": "simple", "start": 211.475, "end": 212.225}, {"text": "but", "start": 212.225, "end": 212.488}, {"t